const gameplay=[['spawn','⚑','Player start'],['teleport','◎','Teleport pad'],[16,'○','Ring'],[20,'◉','Goal ring'],[3,'»','Speed pad'],[1,'↟','Spring'],[5,'⚑','Checkpoint'],[15,'▰','Moving platform']];
function renderPalette(){renderContentBrowser()}
function meshData(g){if(g.index)g=g.toNonIndexed();const p=g.getAttribute('position'),uv=g.getAttribute('uv');const v=[],u=[],t=[];for(let i=0;i<p.count;i++){v.push([p.getX(i),p.getY(i),p.getZ(i)]);u.push(uv?[uv.getX(i),uv.getY(i)]:[0,0]);if(i%3===0)t.push([i,i+1,i+2])}g.dispose();return{vertices:v,uvs:u,triangles:t}}
function rampData(w,h,d){const v=[[-w/2,0,-d/2],[w/2,0,-d/2],[-w/2,0,d/2],[w/2,0,d/2],[-w/2,h,d/2],[w/2,h,d/2]];return{vertices:v,uvs:[[0,0],[1,0],[0,1],[1,1],[0,1],[1,1]],triangles:[[0,4,5],[0,5,1],[0,1,3],[0,3,2],[2,3,5],[2,5,4],[0,2,4],[1,5,3]]}}
function loopData(radius=180,width=100,thickness=12,segments=96){const v=[],u=[],t=[];for(let i=0;i<=segments;i++){const a=i/segments*Math.PI*2;for(const [x,r]of[[-width/2,radius],[width/2,radius],[-width/2,radius+thickness],[width/2,radius+thickness]]){v.push([x,radius-r*Math.cos(a),r*Math.sin(a)]);u.push([x/width+.5,i/segments*12])}if(i<segments){const k=i*4;for(const [a,b,c,d] of [[0,4,5,1],[2,3,7,6],[0,2,6,4],[1,5,7,3]])t.push([k+a,k+b,k+c],[k+a,k+c,k+d])}}return{vertices:v,uvs:u,triangles:t}}
// Where new geometry goes (server.py default_chunk/visual_target agree): a chunk with a visual world and collision
// whose bounds contain the point, else the nearest one. Projects imported before 2026-10-16 lack target/bounds.
function chunkInfo(n){return project.native?.chunks?.find(c=>c.number===n)}
function defaultChunk(pos){const all=project.native?.chunks||[];const vis=c=>c.target??(c.visual||[])[0];const col=c=>c.collisionTarget??(c.collision||[])[0];
 let good=all.filter(c=>vis(c)&&col(c));if(!good.length)good=all.filter(vis);if(!good.length)return null;
 if(!pos||!good.every(c=>c.bounds))return good[0].number;const d=c=>{let s=0;for(let i=0;i<3;i++){const v=Math.max(0,c.bounds[0][i]-pos[i],pos[i]-c.bounds[1][i]);s+=v*v}return s};
 return good.reduce((a,b)=>d(b)<d(a)?b:a).number}
function worldKind(name){const t=String(name||'').toUpperCase().replace(/\.RG1$/,'').split(/[_.]/);return t.includes('O')?'O':t.includes('OS')?'OS':''}
function defaultMaterial(chunk){const c=chunkInfo(chunk);const world=c?.target;const ok=m=>m.texture&&m.chunk===chunk;
 return (project.materials.find(m=>ok(m)&&world&&m.world===world)||project.materials.find(m=>ok(m)&&worldKind(m.world)==='O')||project.materials.find(m=>ok(m)&&worldKind(m.world)==='OS')||project.materials.find(ok))?.id}
function createShape(type,position){const dimensions=type==='loop'?[180,100,12]:[100,30,100];let data;if(type==='ramp')data=rampData(...dimensions);else if(type==='loop')data=loopData(...dimensions);else data=meshData(type==='cylinder'?new THREE.CylinderGeometry(50,50,80,24):new THREE.BoxGeometry(...dimensions));return{id:uuid(),kind:'geometry',name:shapeDefs.find(x=>x[0]===type)?.[2]||'Shape',shape:type,dimensions,position,rotation:[0,0,0],scale:[1,1,1],chunk:defaultChunk(position)??1,collision:true,surface:0x00020001,material:defaultMaterial(defaultChunk(position)??1),uvRepeat:[1,1],colour:[220,220,220,255],...data}}
function place(row,point){snapshot();const pos=point.toArray();let o;
 if(row.kind==='shape'){o=createShape(row.id,pos);project.geometry.push(o)}
 else if(row.kind==='native'){o=clone(row.template||templates.find(o=>o.list===row.list&&o.type===row.type));o.id=uuid();o.position=pos;o.name=row.name;delete o.sourceIndex;project.objects.push(o)}
 else if(row.id==='trigger'){o={id:uuid(),name:'Trigger',kind:'trigger',position:pos,rotation:[0,0,0],scale:[1,1,1],size:[100,100,100],event:'enter',once:true,actions:[{type:'teleport',target:'',delay:0}]};project.triggers.push(o)}
 else if(row.id==='scriptobj'){const n=project.triggers.filter(t=>t.script).length+1;const dest={id:uuid(),kind:'destination',name:'Teleport destination '+n,position:[pos[0],pos[1],pos[2]+150],rotation:[0,0,0],scale:[1,1,1]};project.objects.push(dest);objects.add(makeNode(dest));
  o={id:uuid(),name:'Script object '+n,kind:'trigger',script:'teleport',position:pos,rotation:[0,0,0],scale:[1,1,1],size:[40,40,40],event:'enter',once:false,cooldown:1,actions:[{type:'teleport',target:dest.id,delay:0}],graph:scriptGraph(dest.id)};project.triggers.push(o);message('Script object placed with its paired destination 150 units ahead. Drag the destination where the player should land.','info')}
 else if(row.id==='path'){o={id:uuid(),name:'Path',kind:'path',position:pos,rotation:[0,0,0],scale:[1,1,1],pathType:'rail',splineId:Math.max(1000,...project.paths.map(p=>p.splineId||0))+1,autoOrient:true,closed:false,points:[[0,0,0],[0,0,150],[100,30,300]],banking:0};project.paths.push(o)}
 else{o={id:uuid(),name:row.name,kind:row.id,position:pos,rotation:[0,0,0],scale:[1,1,1],target:'',speed:150,cooldown:1};project.objects.push(o)}
 (o.kind==='geometry'?authored:objects).add(makeNode(o));placing=null;$('placing').hidden=true;select(o.id);changed();if(o.shape==='loop')message('Loop geometry created. Inverted running and camera behaviour still need game integration.','warning')}
function beginDraw(){if(!project)return;placing=null;drawing=true;drawPlaneY=Number(document.getElementById('drawHeight').value)||0;drawPoints=[];$('placing').hidden=false;$('placing').textContent='Draw on ground plane: click corners · Enter finishes · Esc cancels';$('finishDraw').hidden=false;status('Draw a polygon on the Y=0 plane')}
function finishDraw(){if(drawPoints.length<3){message('A shape needs at least three corners.','warning');return}const points=drawPoints.map(p=>new THREE.Vector2(p.x,-p.z));const shape=new THREE.Shape(points);const g=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:30,bevelEnabled:false,steps:1});g.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);g.translate(0,drawPlaneY,0);const data=meshData(g);snapshot();const o={...createShape('box',[0,0,0]),...data,name:'Drawn platform',shape:'polygon',outline:drawPoints.map(p=>p.toArray())};project.geometry.push(o);authored.add(makeNode(o));cancelPlacement();select(o.id);changed()}
function cancelPlacement(){placing=null;drawing=false;drawPoints=[];dispose(preview);$('placing').hidden=true;$('finishDraw').hidden=true;status('Ready')}
function pointerRay(e){const r=renderer.domElement.getBoundingClientRect();pointer.set((e.clientX-r.left)/r.width*2-1,-(e.clientY-r.top)/r.height*2+1);raycaster.setFromCamera(pointer,camera)}
let pointerStart;
renderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(e.button===0)pointerStart=[e.clientX,e.clientY]});
renderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointerup',e=>{if(e.button!==0||!project||gizmo.dragging||!pointerStart||Math.hypot(e.clientX-pointerStart[0],e.clientY-pointerStart[1])>4)return;pointerRay(e);if(drawing){const p=new THREE.Vector3();raycaster.ray.intersectPlane(new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,1,0),-drawPlaneY),p);const snap=Number($('snap').value)||1;p.x=Math.round(p.x/snap)*snap;p.z=Math.round(p.z/snap)*snap;drawPoints.push(p);dispose(preview);preview.add(new THREE.Line(new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(drawPoints),new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xff667d})));return}if(placing){const hit=raycaster.intersectObjects([...authored.children,...refs.children,...collisionRefs.children],true).find(h=>actuallyVisible(h.object));const p=hit?.point.clone()||new THREE.Vector3();if(!hit)raycaster.ray.intersectPlane(new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,1,0),0),p);const snap=Number($('snap').value);if(snap>0)p.toArray().forEach((v,i)=>p.setComponent(i,Math.round(v/snap)*snap));place(placing,p);return}if($('editCollisionFaces')?.checked){const face=raycaster.intersectObjects([...killRefs.children,...collisionRefs.children],true).find(h=>actuallyVisible(h.object));if(face){editCollisionFace(face);return}}// anything solid under the cursor wins over the invisible volumes around it (lights, triggers): click into them
 const hits=raycaster.intersectObjects([...objects.children,...authored.children],true).filter(h=>h.object.userData.id&&actuallyVisible(h.object));const inVolume=obj=>{for(let n=obj;n;n=n.parent)if(n.userData.volume)return true;return false};const hit=hits.find(h=>!inVolume(h.object))||hits[0];if(targetPicker){const id=hit?.object.userData.id;if(id){const pick=targetPicker;targetPicker=null;pick(id);status('Target selected')}return}select(hit?.object.userData.id||null)});
function select(id,inspect=true){selected=id;const n=nodes.get(id);if(n){selectionBox.setFromObject(n);selectionBox.visible=true;gizmo.attach(n)}else{selectionBox.visible=false;gizmo.detach()}if(inspect){renderInspector();$('inspector').scrollTop=0}renderHierarchy();renderGraph();$('selectionInfo').textContent=item()?.name||'No selection'}
function focus(){const n=nodes.get(selected);if(!n)return;const box=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(n),c=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3());const dist=Math.max(box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()).length()*1.7,25);const dir=camera.position.clone().sub(orbit.target).normalize();orbit.target.copy(c);camera.position.copy(c).addScaledVector(dir,dist);orbit.update()}
gizmo.addEventListener('dragging-changed',e=>{orbit.enabled=!e.value;if(e.value)snapshot();else{const o=item(),n=nodes.get(selected);if(o&&n){o.position=n.position.toArray();o.rotation=[n.rotation.x,n.rotation.y,n.rotation.z].map(THREE.MathUtils.radToDeg);o.scale=n.scale.toArray();changed();renderInspector()}}});
